paragraph.math:
$$\underset{n\rightarrow\infty}{\text{lim}}\,P^{n} = \text{Π} = \left\lbrack \mathbf{q} \mathbf{q} \cdots  \mathbf{q} \right\rbrack = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{llll}
    q_{1} & q_{1} & \cdots & q_{1} \\
    q_{2} & q_{2} & \cdots & q_{2} \\
     \vdots & \vdots & \ddots & \vdots \\
    q_{m} & q_{m} & \cdots & q_{m}
    \end{array} \right\rbrack$$

$$\begin{matrix}
    {\underset{n\rightarrow\infty}{\text{lim}}\,P^{n}\mathbf{x}_{0}} & = & {\underset{n\rightarrow\infty}{\text{lim}}\,P^{n}\left( x_{1}\mathbf{e}_{1} + \ldots + x_{m}\mathbf{e}_{m} \right)} \\
     & = & {x_{1}\text{(}\underset{n\rightarrow\infty}{\text{lim}}\,P^{n}\mathbf{e}_{1}\text{)} + \ldots + x_{m}\text{(}\underset{n\rightarrow\infty}{\text{lim}}\mspace{2mu} P^{n}\mathbf{e}_{m}\text{)}} \\
     & = & {x_{1}\left( \text{Π}\mathbf{e}_{1} \right) + \ldots + x_{m}\left( \text{Π}\mathbf{e}_{m} \right) = x_{1}\mathbf{q} + \ldots + x_{m}\mathbf{q}} \\
     & = & {\left( x_{1} + \ldots + x_{m} \right)\mathbf{q} = \mathbf{q}}
    \end{matrix}$$

$$\begin{matrix}
    {\text{Π}\textbf{w}} & {= \text{[}\mathbf{q} \mathbf{q} \cdots  \mathbf{q}\text{]\,}\textbf{w}} \\
     & {= w_{1}\textbf{q} + w_{2}\textbf{q} + \cdots + w_{m}\textbf{q}} \\
     & {= \left( w_{1} + w_{2} + \cdots + w_{m} \right)\textbf{q} = 0\textbf{q} = 0}
    \end{matrix}$$
